@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
title Ticket Loop - Planning, Dependencies and Delivery

state "Define behavior Tickets\nThen define ordered Slices inside each Ticket\nAcceptance / scope / dependencies / validation" as plan
state "Resolve repository + base + Issue access\nSearch stable plan/Ticket markers" as lookup
state "Reuse unique matches or create Issues\nParent plan -> all initial Tickets -> parent index\nPersist Status / Branch / Base / Dependencies / PR" as persist
state "Planning blocked\nReport ambiguity or failed persistence\nKeep created Issue links; no local ticket mirror" as plan_blocked #FFF4CC
state "Select unfinished Ticket\nRead authoritative Issue + dependency evidence" as select
state "Dependency gate\nPrerequisite PRs merged?" as dependency
state "Dependency wait [blocked; Issue open]\nRecord prerequisite + reason\nNo implementation branch work yet" as wait_dep #FFF4CC
state "Sync actual base; create/resume Ticket branch\nVerify Branch/Base metadata\nStatus: in_progress" as branch
state "Execute Ticket Slices\nSee ticket-slice-loop.svg\nAll Slices share this Ticket's branch" as slices
state "Publish / review / fix / merge\nSee ticket-review-loop.svg\nIssue remains open until verified merge" as deliver
state "Verified merged\nClean exact source branch; sync base\nStatus: done; close Ticket; keep PR reference" as done #DCFCE7
state "Reconcile State/Docs if changed\nTracked follow-up edits use a new branch + PR" as state_docs
state "Plan complete\nAll Ticket PRs merged; no open blockers" as complete #DCFCE7

[*] --> plan
plan --> lookup
lookup --> persist : no ambiguity; access works
lookup --> plan_blocked : access failure / duplicate matches
persist --> plan_blocked : any required write fails
plan_blocked --> lookup : cause resolved; re-read first
persist --> select : all required writes verified
select --> dependency : Ticket remains
select --> complete : all Tickets delivered
dependency --> wait_dep : not yet merged
wait_dep --> dependency : dependency event / scheduled recheck
dependency --> branch : prerequisites merged
branch --> slices
slices --> deliver : Ticket acceptance + integration checks pass
slices --> plan : design/scope assumption invalid\nupdate same Issues; preserve valid work
deliver --> done : reviewed head + required checks + merge verified
done --> state_docs
state_docs --> select : next Ticket; use updated base
complete --> [*]

note right of persist
Parent Issue: milestones + Ticket links.
Ticket Issue: behavior + nested Slice plan + current state.
One Ticket = one Issue = one implementation branch / PR.
Slices do not create separate branches or ticket Issues.
end note
note right of wait_dep
Unchanged state is not a reason for a tight retry loop.
Work on a different ready Ticket only when authorized
and ownership boundaries permit; keep dependencies intact.
end note
@enduml
